div.p:
—During the Parliamentary debate on November 24, Wills commented
                    favorably—deliberately—on the U.S. Federal Grand Jury investigation of Cuban
                    exiles in Miami;

—Guyana is co-sponsoring a UN resolution (on
                    non-interference in internal affairs of states) which refers repeatedly to
                    “destabilization”—again without specific mention of the U.S.;
